<title>UK: Osborne &amp; Little shares down, chairman sells.</title>
<headline>Osborne &amp; Little shares down, chairman sells.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Osborne &amp; Little fell on Friday after news that chairman Peter Osborne had sold 40,000 of his shares in the company.</p>
<p>Osborne &amp; Little shares were 75p weaker at 845 by 1604 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
